ut this is where  everyone would go to relax to unwind and  to play there are these  fabulous old descriptions and ancient  texts of  seeing drunk people walking on the beach  there's this one wonderful line about  how  luxury had claimed bayer for her own  resort it was this place there were  murder plots  it was this extravagant place which were  actually architects  also got to experiment they were testing  things out in some cases  using materials that then would later be  used in  in the capital in rome what did you  learn about the people who vacationed  there  rich wealthy powerful they went down  there because of this  volcanic activity that wound up being  the downfall of baya  they went down there because there were  these thermal baths and they built these  villas these elaborate villas along the  beach and you can see the money in  in how they spent the money in those  mosaics in some cases  really elaborate colors the reds coming  from egypt others coming from turkey or  greece  seth doan thank you very much it looks  just fascinating i wish i could go  you can watch this full report right now  on 60 minutes plus on the viacom cbs  streaming service  paramount plus
 

